endance Financial Aid Scholarships Loans Grants Work-study Pay Your Bill Red Wolf Life Where to Eat, Gather & Study Life Off-Campus Student Organizations Events & Activities Red Wolf Central Academic & Student Support Career Readiness Health & Wellness Social Media Athletics Red Wolf Central Calendars Register for classes Academic progress & changes Grades Transcripts Personal information Graduation Policies Contact Us IU Info Online Degrees & certificates How to apply Tuition & financial aid Test drive the online experience Admitted students Contact Alumni & Friends Alumni Association Celebrating Alumni Ways to Give Events Apply Now Indiana University East Home Red Wolf Central Academic progress & changes Check your degree progress Check your degree progress Find out how close you are to earning your degree You can use Stellic to review the requirements of your degree and how close you are to graduating. This tool also allows you to see how your courses might apply to a different major. Stellic Viewing your Academic Progress in Stellic To see your degree progress based on your current school and major, you’ll use the Stellic Track Progress feature. Read this Knowledge Base article on how to track your academic progress in Stellic . Viewing your academic progress in Stellic isn’t a substitute for meeting regularly with your academic advisor. Use it to prepare for your advising sessions. Creating a what-if report If you’re considering changing your major, you can analyze how the courses you’ve already taken will apply to a new program of study. See the Stellic quick start guide for students for more information. Plan ahead with Stellic Success doesn’t just happen—you have to plan for it. The degree management tool allows you to create schedules, track progress toward graduation, and discover guided pathways that help you progress toward your goals. One part of degree progress is finding the right classes for your degree. Work with your advisor and the tools in Stellic to plan and find the classes that are offered each semester. Learn more about Stellic , and begin planning your path. Calendars Academic calendar Long-term calendar Register for classes Schedule of classes Steps to register Holds & problems registering Drop & add classes Late drop/add Waitlist a class Audit a class Textbooks & Course Materials Placement Tests & Credit by Examination Academic progress & changes Grades View your grades Student performance alerts Calculate your GPA Grading systems Grade changes & retaking classes Incompletes Pass/fail option Failure to attend Final exams Transcripts Personal information Graduation Policies Financial Agreement Student code of conduct Email Immunizations Academic misconduct Dismissal & reinstatement Academic standing for athletes School/program specific policies Contact Us IU Info Indiana University East resources and social media channels Request info Student Research Twitter Facebook Instagram YouTube Snapchat Contact, Address, and Additional Links About IU East News Events Chancellor Our Mission About Jobs Email & Services Canvas One.IU IU Email (Exchange Online) Cloud Storage Resources Knowledge Base IT Help & Training Student Success Faculty & Staff Resources Non-Discrimination Notice Consumer Disclosures Find Courses Academic Calendar Bookstore Campus Maps Safety & Emergency Info Health & Wellness Info Indiana University East 2325 Chester Blvd Richmond, IN 47374 Directions ( Google | iPhone ) 765-973-8200 RedWolf@iu.edu Accessibility | College Scorecard | Open to All | Privacy Notice | Copyright © 2026 The Trustees of Indiana University"
