inancial Aid Scholarships Loans Grants Work-study Pay Your Bill Red Wolf Life Where to Eat, Gather & Study Life Off-Campus Student Organizations Events & Activities Red Wolf Central Academic & Student Support Career Readiness Health & Wellness Social Media Athletics Red Wolf Central Calendars Register for classes Academic progress & changes Grades Transcripts Personal information Graduation Policies Contact Us IU Info Online Degrees & certificates How to apply Tuition & financial aid Test drive the online experience Admitted students Contact Alumni & Friends Alumni Association Celebrating Alumni Ways to Give Events Apply Now Indiana University East Home Red Wolf Central Academic progress & changes Change your major Change your major Thinking of taking a different path? Maybe you’ve decided that your chosen major isn’t for you, or perhaps you want to add a second major! It’s easy to change or add a major/minor. Step 1: Talk to your current advisor Contact your academic advisor to discuss your current progress and how it might apply to the program requirements of your desired major/minor. You can review your academic progress and plan of study through your planner and academic advisement report . Your advisor can assist you in using these tools to make the best decisions about your academic goals. Find your current advisor Step 2: Work with your new academic advisor Changing your major will typically mean that you will have a new academic advisor. You will need to take, or scan and email, the completed Change of Major/Minor form to your new academic advisor for their review and signature; he or she will then send the completed form to the Office of the Registrar for processing. Schedule a meeting with your new advisor to discuss your new program's requirements and plan your new path! Find your new advisor Study at another IU campus If you want to enroll at another IU campus on a temporary or permanent basis, you’ll need to submit an intercampus transfer application. Transfer to another university If your desired major or program is not offered through IU and you'd like to transfer to another university, learn how to get started here. Calendars Academic calendar Long-term calendar Register for classes Schedule of classes Steps to register Holds & problems registering Drop & add classes Late drop/add Waitlist a class Audit a class Textbooks & Course Materials Placement Tests & Credit by Examination Academic progress & changes Grades View your grades Student performance alerts Calculate your GPA Grading systems Grade changes & retaking classes Incompletes Pass/fail option Failure to attend Final exams Transcripts Personal information Graduation Policies Financial Agreement Student code of conduct Email Immunizations Academic misconduct Dismissal & reinstatement Academic standing for athletes School/program specific policies Contact Us IU Info Indiana University East resources and social media channels Request info Student Research Twitter Facebook Instagram YouTube Snapchat Contact, Address, and Additional Links About IU East News Events Chancellor Our Mission About Jobs Email & Services Canvas One.IU IU Email (Exchange Online) Cloud Storage Resources Knowledge Base IT Help & Training Student Success Faculty & Staff Resources Non-Discrimination Notice Consumer Disclosures Find Courses Academic Calendar Bookstore Campus Maps Safety & Emergency Info Health & Wellness Info Indiana University East 2325 Chester Blvd Richmond, IN 47374 Directions ( Google | iPhone ) 765-973-8200 RedWolf@iu.edu Accessibility | College Scorecard | Open to All | Privacy Notice | Copyright © 2026 The Trustees of Indiana University"
