ia Athletics Red Wolf Central Calendars Academic calendar Long-term calendar Register for classes Schedule of classes Steps to register Holds & problems registering Drop & add classes Late drop/add Waitlist a class Audit a class Textbooks & Course Materials Placement Tests & Credit by Examination Academic progress & changes Grades View your grades Student performance alerts Calculate your GPA Grading systems Grade changes & retaking classes Incompletes Pass/fail option Failure to attend Final exams Transcripts Personal information Graduation Policies Financial Agreement Student code of conduct Email Immunizations Academic misconduct Dismissal & reinstatement Academic standing for athletes School/program specific policies Contact Us IU Info Online Degrees & certificates How to apply International Students Tuition & financial aid Test drive the online experience Admitted students Contact us Alumni & Friends Alumni Association Contact Us Celebrating Alumni Alumni Hall of Fame Alumni Legacy Circle Ways to Give Events Apply Now Home Admissions How to apply Financial Aid & Scholarships Visit IU East Undergraduate Viewbook Admitted students IU East Groups Scholars Contact Academics Colleges Degrees, Majors & Certificates Minors Graduate Programs Honors Program Education Abroad Library Cost & Financial Aid Cost of Attendance Financial Aid Scholarships Loans Grants Work-study Pay Your Bill Red Wolf Life Where to Eat, Gather & Study Life Off-Campus Student Organizations Events & Activities Red Wolf Central Academic & Student Support Career Readiness Health & Wellness Social Media Athletics Red Wolf Central Calendars Register for classes Academic progress & changes Grades Transcripts Personal information Graduation Policies Contact Us IU Info Online Degrees & certificates How to apply Tuition & financial aid Test drive the online experience Admitted students Contact Alumni & Friends Alumni Association Celebrating Alumni Ways to Give Events Apply Now Indiana University East Home Jobs Jobs Join the IU East team! Indiana University East is a great place to work, learn and grow. We offer a variety of employment opportunities and realize our biggest investment is the collective knowledge, skills and abilities of our talent. Current Opportunities Indiana University East is currently accepting applications and resumes for the following positions. If you would like to apply for any of these positions please check out employment opportunities at jobs.iu.edu . Faculty Positions Apply online at jobs.iu.edu Staff Positions Apply online at jobs.iu.edu Student Jobs and Internships Learn more about campus student employment Benefits Health Medical and dental care, Health Savings Account, and prescription coverage Paid time off Vacation, sick days, parental leave, volunteer leave, and military leave Tuition Reduced costs for employees and their spouses and dependents Retirement Retirement plans, supplemental plans, and other resources Insurance Life, long-term disability, and personal accident insurance Child care Resources for finding and hiring prescreened caregivers Learn more on the Human Resources website . Why Richmond, Indiana? Things to do Enjoy plenty of great local food, recreational opportunities, and attractions, and for even more, there are three major metropolitan areas just a short drive away. 20.4% below the U.S. average cost of living! Your money goes further here. According to Kiplinger Music culture Hoagy Carmichael, Duke Ellington & Louis Armstrong recorded some of the first jazz records here ! Local musicians abound and delight crowds at our farmer's markets & festivals. The Richmond Symphony Orchestra enchants the ears in the performance hall, community, and through educational children's programs. 62 miles of paved trails originate here! Bike, hike, jog, and enjoy seasonal events! Check out the Cardinal Greenways Community Growth People care about Wayne County. Our ever-evolving community offers more opportunity, livability, entertainment, and engagement every year. Discover what Wayne County has to offer you! Find out why we feel #homeinwayne 16 parks! Enjoy the sensory playground, pickleball courts, 177-acre lake, dog park, pool & more! Play here! Campus Student Employment Indiana University East resources and social media channels Request info Student Research Twitter Facebook Instagram YouTube Snapchat Contact, Address, and Additional Links About IU East News Events Chancellor Our Mission About Jobs Email & Services Canvas One.IU IU Email (Exchange Online) Cloud Storage Resources Knowledge Base IT Help & Training Student Success Faculty & Staff Resources Non-Discrimination Notice Consumer Disclosures Find Courses Academic Calendar Bookstore Campus Maps Safety & Emergency Info Health & Wellness Info Indiana University East 2325 Chester Blvd Richmond, IN 47374 Directions ( Google | iPhone ) 765-973-8200 RedWolf@iu.edu Accessibility | College Scorecard | Open to All | Privacy Notice | Copyright © 2026 The Trustees of Indiana University"
